                                                "sense_id": "95a5fe9f-1ec2-3c0f-a268-74807bba0ae3",
                                                "text": "Researchers worry that the people who are building artificial intelligence systems may be building their own biases into the technology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b0d64b2-d281-4a7c-ba35-0a89cc90c802",
                                                "sense_id": "95a5fe9f-1ec2-3c0f-a268-74807bba0ae3",
                                                "text": "Reshaping [of British Railways] was far from perfect. It was tainted by statistical overreach, the unconscious biases of its author, and by the political demands being placed upon the BRB by government."
